<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Rykoff EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Rykoff EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Thursday it raised its earnings-per-share estimates on Rykoff-Sexton Inc to $0.60 from $0.54 for FY97 and to $0.92 from $0.89 for FY98.</p>
<p>--It maintained a neutral rating on the stock.</p>
<p>--The stock of Rykoff-Sexton, a distributor to the foodservice industry, ended up 1/2 at 15-7/8 in NYSE trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
